DESCRIPTION:Venue: Revolver\nTags: post-hardcore\, shoegaze\n\nTramhaus is 
 a live wire five-piece band from Rotterdam\, heralded for their energetic 
 shows and riveting song material. The band is known for their broad and ev
 er-electrifying sound that reaches from post-hardcore to shoegaze to punk 
 rock. This amalgam is a product of the diverse and rich musical tastes of 
 its members. Nonetheless\, in a live setting the band forms a strong union
 . It makes sure to grab the audience from the first to the last note in a 
 maelstrom of emotions. In its short existence\, the symbiotic group toured
  endlessly\, gaining popularity along the way.\n\nTickets: https://revolve
 roslo.ticketco.events/no/nb/e/tramhous_nl__revolver\n
LOCATION:Revolver
SUMMARY:Tramhaus (NL)
X-WR-CALNAME:oslogigguide
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Oslo
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT24H
